sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reporter
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant Photos as Photo Storage
  participant TS as Ticket Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Auto as Auto Routing Worker
  participant Dept as Department Service

  Reporter->>GW: POST /tickets with report fields and optional Idempotency-Key
  Note over GW: Require signed-in reporter and validate required fields
  alt Matching submission already exists
    GW->>TS: gRPC FindSubmission with reporter id and content fingerprint
    TS->>PG: Look up reporter id and submission key
    PG-->>TS: Matching ticket and fingerprint
    TS-->>GW: Return the existing ticket
    GW-->>Reporter: Return prior result without creating a duplicate
  else New submission or no matching key
    opt Idempotency-Key supplied
      GW->>TS: gRPC FindSubmission with reporter id and content fingerprint
      TS->>PG: Look up reporter id and submission key
      PG-->>TS: No matching submission
      TS-->>GW: Continue with new ticket
    end
    Note over GW,TS: Reusing a key with different content returns 409
    opt Photos attached
      GW->>Photos: Store photos in Cloudinary or local uploads volume
      Photos-->>GW: Photo URLs
    end
    GW->>TS: gRPC CreateTicket with reporter identity key and fingerprint
    TS->>PG: Begin transaction and write SUBMITTED ticket history and outbox
    opt Automatic routing enabled
      TS->>PG: Also create PENDING routing job
    end
    PG-->>TS: Commit successful
    TS-->>GW: Ticket id and SUBMITTED status
    GW-->>Reporter: 201 ticket created
  end

  opt Automatic routing enabled
    Note over Auto,PG: Worker polls every 2 s and leases a due job
    Auto->>PG: Claim routing job and load ticket
    PG-->>Auto: Ticket category and lease token
    Auto->>Dept: POST /routing-rules/match with category and 3 s timeout
    alt Exactly one enabled rule matches
      Dept-->>Auto: MATCHED with department and rule id
      Auto->>PG: Atomic update ASSIGNED plus history outbox and job DONE
      PG-->>Auto: Commit successful
    else No rule or ambiguous rules
      Dept-->>Auto: NO_RULE or AMBIGUOUS_RULES
      Auto->>PG: Keep ticket SUBMITTED and mark routing job REVIEW
      PG-->>Auto: Review state saved
    end
    Note over Auto,Dept: Transient errors retry with backoff. Stale results are ignored
  end
